---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
	title="Sula Chai Café Menu | Indian Chai, Alai Coffee, Paninis & Pastries Vancouver"
	description="Full Sula Chai Café menu, masala chai, lavender chai, gulabi chai, Alai Coffee creations, paninis on masala focaccia, croissants, cruffins, samosas, and freshly baked cookies."
	canonical="/menu"
>

	<section class="hero">
		<div class="hero-content">
			<span class="eyebrow-italic">Sula Chai Café Menu</span>
			<h1>Sip, savour, <em>and indulge.</em></h1>
			<div class="premium-divider">
				<div class="pd-thin"></div>
				<div class="pd-thick"></div>
				<div class="pd-diamond"></div>
				<div class="pd-thick"></div>
				<div class="pd-thin-r"></div>
			</div>
			<p class="hero-tagline">Authentic Sula chai. Exclusive Alai Coffee. Indian-inspired baked goods made fresh every morning. Paninis pressed in masala focaccia.</p>
			<div class="hero-buttons">
				<a href="https://www.order.store/store/sula-cafe/0egsttFCUIahN8Ja4Uqhtw" class="cta" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
					<span class="cta-badge">
						<img src="https://sulacafe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/sula-cafe-logo-2026.webp" alt="" />
					</span>
					Order on UberEats
				</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section section-cream-reverse reveal" id="chai">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="intro-block">
				<span class="eyebrow-italic">Sula Chai</span>
				<h2>Chai blends, <em>brewed slow.</em></h2>
				<div class="premium-divider">
					<div class="pd-thin"></div>
					<div class="pd-thick"></div>
					<div class="pd-diamond"></div>
					<div class="pd-thick"></div>
					<div class="pd-thin-r"></div>
				</div>
				<p>Premium Indian tea leaves from Coorg and Chikmagalur. Layered with traditional spices and nostalgic Indian flavours, reimagined into modern artisanal chai.</p>
			</div>

			<div class="card-grid-3" style="margin-top:60px">
				<div class="card reveal delay-100">
					<div class="card-top-stripe"></div>
					<div class="card-img" style="height:240px">
						<img src="https://sulacafe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Masala-chai.webp" alt="Sula Classic Masala Chai" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover" />
					</div>
					<div class="card-content">
						<span class="eyebrow">Hand-Brewed</span>
						<h3>Sula Classic <em>Masala Chai</em></h3>
						<p>Cardamom, ginger, clove and pepper, slow-brewed with Assam tea and whole milk.</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="card reveal delay-200">
					<div class="card-top-stripe"></div>
					<div class="card-img" style="height:240px">
						<img src="https://sulacafe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Lavender-chai.webp" alt="Lavender Chai" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover" />
					</div>
					<div class="card-content">
						<span class="eyebrow">Floral & Calm</span>
						<h3>Lavender <em>Chai</em></h3>
						<p>Soft lavender notes layered into our masala base. Aromatic and soothing.</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="card reveal delay-300">
					<div class="card-top-stripe"></div>
					<div class="card-img" style="height:240px">
						<img src="https://sulacafe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/IMG_2965.webp" alt="Pistachio Chai" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover" />
					</div>
					<div class="card-content">
						<span class="eyebrow">From Royal Kitchens</span>
						<h3>Pistachio <em>Chai</em></h3>
						<p>Roasted pistachios infused into rich masala chai. Nutty, creamy, decadent.</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="card reveal delay-100" style="margin-top:24px">
					<div class="card-top-stripe"></div>
					<div class="card-img" style="height:240px">
						<img src="https://sulacafe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/chai-near-me-2.webp" alt="Spicy Ginger Chai" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover" />
					</div>
					<div class="card-content">
						<span class="eyebrow">Bold & Warming</span>
						<h3>Spicy Ginger <em>Chai</em></h3>
						<p>Generous fresh ginger for a sharp, warming brew. The morning wake-up call.</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="card reveal delay-200" style="margin-top:24px">
					<div class="card-top-stripe"></div>
					<div class="card-img" style="height:240px">
						<img src="https://sulacafe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Rose-chai.webp" alt="Gulabi Chai with rose petals" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover" />
					</div>
					<div class="card-content">
						<span class="eyebrow">From Ancient Markets</span>
						<h3>Gulabi <em>Chai</em></h3>
						<p>Rose petal chai with a delicate floral finish. Pink, fragrant, romantic.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section section-tan reveal" id="coffee">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="intro-block">
				<span class="eyebrow-italic">Alai Coffee</span>
				<h2>Crafted by Alai. <em>Brewed at Sula.</em></h2>
				<div class="premium-divider">
					<div class="pd-thin"></div>
					<div class="pd-thick"></div>
					<div class="pd-diamond"></div>
					<div class="pd-thick"></div>
					<div class="pd-thin-r"></div>
				</div>
				<p>Exclusive Sula Blend by Alai Coffee, sourced from Chikmagalur and Odisha. Original creations inspired by India's dessert traditions.</p>
			</div>

			<div class="card-grid-3" style="margin-top:60px">
				<div class="card reveal delay-100">
					<div class="card-top-stripe"></div>
					<div class="card-img" style="height:240px">
						<img src="https://sulacafe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/a4.jpg" alt="Jaggery Velvet Latte" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover" />
					</div>
					<div class="card-content">
						<span class="eyebrow">Warm Jaggery</span>
						<h3>Jaggery Velvet <em>Latte</em></h3>
						<p>Smooth espresso with traditional Indian jaggery. Earthy sweetness, velvety finish.</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="card reveal delay-200">
					<div class="card-top-stripe"></div>
					<div class="card-img" style="height:240px">
						<img src="https://sulacafe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/a2.jpg" alt="Masala Monsoon Misto" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover" />
					</div>
					<div class="card-content">
						<span class="eyebrow">Monsoon Spice</span>
						<h3>Masala Monsoon <em>Misto</em></h3>
						<p>Espresso meets warming masala spice. Half coffee, half steamed milk, all character.</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="card reveal delay-300">
					<div class="card-top-stripe"></div>
					<div class="card-img" style="height:240px">
						<img src="https://sulacafe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/cappuccino.jpg" alt="Coastal Coconut Cappuccino" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover" />
					</div>
					<div class="card-content">
						<span class="eyebrow">Coast of Kerala</span>
						<h3>Coastal Coconut <em>Cappuccino</em></h3>
						<p>Espresso with coconut milk foam. Toasted, tropical, distinctly Indian.</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="card reveal delay-100" style="margin-top:24px">
					<div class="card-top-stripe"></div>
					<div class="card-img" style="height:240px">
						<img src="https://sulacafe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/a3.jpg" alt="Malai Pista Mocha" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover" />
					</div>
					<div class="card-content">
						<span class="eyebrow">Fragrant Pistachio</span>
						<h3>Malai Pista <em>Mocha</em></h3>
						<p>Rich pistachio cream and chocolate over espresso. Indian dessert in a cup.</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="card reveal delay-200" style="margin-top:24px">
					<div class="card-top-stripe"></div>
					<div class="card-img" style="height:240px">
						<img src="https://sulacafe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/filter-coffee.webp" alt="Indian Filter Coffee" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover" />
					</div>
					<div class="card-content">
						<span class="eyebrow">South Indian</span>
						<h3>Indian Filter <em>Coffee</em></h3>
						<p>Traditional South Indian filter coffee. Robust, frothy, served the proper way.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section section-cream-deep reveal" id="savory">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="intro-block">
				<span class="eyebrow-italic">Savoury</span>
				<h2>Paninis & <em>street food.</em></h2>
				<div class="premium-divider">
					<div class="pd-thin"></div>
					<div class="pd-thick"></div>
					<div class="pd-diamond"></div>
					<div class="pd-thick"></div>
					<div class="pd-thin-r"></div>
				</div>
				<p>House-made masala focaccia from Union Market, samosas with chutneys, and warming masala soups. Comfort food with depth.</p>
			</div>

			<div class="card-grid-3" style="margin-top:60px">
				<div class="card reveal delay-100">
					<div class="card-top-stripe"></div>
					<div class="card-img" style="height:240px">
						<img src="https://sulacafe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/PXL_20251217_194925352.PORTRAIT.webp" alt="Chimichurri Paneer Panini" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover" />
					</div>
					<div class="card-content">
						<span class="eyebrow">Vegetarian</span>
						<h3>Chimichurri Paneer <em>Panini</em></h3>
						<p>Fresh chimichurri spread, masala paneer, spinach, mozzarella, sundried tomatoes, arugula. Pressed in masala focaccia.</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="card reveal delay-200">
					<div class="card-top-stripe"></div>
					<div class="card-img" style="height:240px">
						<img src="https://sulacafe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Pesto-chicken-tikka-panini.webp" alt="Pesto Chicken Tikka Panini" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover" />
					</div>
					<div class="card-content">
						<span class="eyebrow">Bestseller</span>
						<h3>Pesto Chicken Tikka <em>Panini</em></h3>
						<p>Juicy chicken tikka, fresh pesto, tandoori spicy mayo, mozzarella, sundried tomatoes, arugula. Pressed in masala focaccia.</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="card reveal delay-300">
					<div class="card-top-stripe"></div>
					<div class="card-img" style="height:240px">
						<img src="https://sulacafe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/cafe-near-me.webp" alt="Paneer or Chicken Panini XL" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover" />
					</div>
					<div class="card-content">
						<span class="eyebrow">Hearty Size</span>
						<h3>Paneer/Chicken <em>Panini XL</em></h3>
						<p>The full version. Pesto or chimichurri, tandoori mayo, mozzarella, sundried tomatoes, arugula. In masala focaccia.</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="card reveal delay-100" style="margin-top:24px">
					<div class="card-top-stripe"></div>
					<div class="card-img" style="height:240px">
						<img src="https://sulacafe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/tomato-red-pepper-soup.webp" alt="Masala Tomato Red Pepper Soup" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover" />
					</div>
					<div class="card-content">
						<span class="eyebrow">Comfort</span>
						<h3>Masala Tomato & <em>Red Pepper Soup</em></h3>
						<p>Slow-roasted tomatoes and red peppers, simmered with warming Indian spices. Velvety, rich.</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="card reveal delay-200" style="margin-top:24px">
					<div class="card-top-stripe"></div>
					<div class="card-img" style="height:240px">
						<img src="https://sulacafe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Chutney-cheese-croissant.webp" alt="Herb Chutney Cheese Croissant" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover" />
					</div>
					<div class="card-content">
						<span class="eyebrow">Savoury Pastry</span>
						<h3>Herb Chutney <em>Cheese Croissant</em></h3>
						<p>Spiced green chutney layered with melted cheese inside a buttery croissant.</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="card reveal delay-300" style="margin-top:24px">
					<div class="card-top-stripe"></div>
					<div class="card-img" style="height:240px">
						<img src="https://sulacafe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/samosa-near-me.webp" alt="Vegetable Samosa with chutneys" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover" />
					</div>
					<div class="card-content">
						<span class="eyebrow">Classic Street Food</span>
						<h3>Vegetable <em>Samosa</em></h3>
						<p>Homemade classic vegetable samosas served with tamarind and mint chutneys.</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="card reveal delay-100" style="margin-top:24px">
					<div class="card-top-stripe"></div>
					<div class="card-img" style="height:240px">
						<img src="https://sulacafe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/chai-near-me.webp" alt="Samosa Croissant" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover" />
					</div>
					<div class="card-content">
						<span class="eyebrow">Sula Original</span>
						<h3>Samosa <em>Croissant</em></h3>
						<p>Twist on the classic. Peas, potatoes, and warming spices folded into a flaky croissant.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section section-tan reveal" id="sweets">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="intro-block">
				<span class="eyebrow-italic">Sweets</span>
				<h2>Cruffins, croissants, <em>and pastries.</em></h2>
				<div class="premium-divider">
					<div class="pd-thin"></div>
					<div class="pd-thick"></div>
					<div class="pd-diamond"></div>
					<div class="pd-thick"></div>
					<div class="pd-thin-r"></div>
				</div>
				<p>Indian local bakery favourites with a Vancouver twist. Spiced, layered, and freshly baked every morning.</p>
			</div>

			<div class="card-grid-3" style="margin-top:60px">
				<div class="card reveal delay-100">
					<div class="card-top-stripe"></div>
					<div class="card-img" style="height:240px">
						<img src="https://sulacafe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/butter-croissiant-sula-cafe-vancouver.webp" alt="Butter Croissant" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover" />
					</div>
					<div class="card-content">
						<span class="eyebrow">Classic French</span>
						<h3>Butter <em>Croissant</em></h3>
						<p>Crisp, buttery layers and a tender, airy crumb. The classic, done right.</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="card reveal delay-200">
					<div class="card-top-stripe"></div>
					<div class="card-img" style="height:240px">
						<img src="https://sulacafe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/morning-glory-muffin-sugar-free.webp" alt="Spiced Morning Glory Muffin sugar free" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover" />
					</div>
					<div class="card-content">
						<span class="eyebrow">Sugar Free</span>
						<h3>Spiced Morning <em>Glory Muffin</em></h3>
						<p>A wholesome blend of carrots, apples, coconut and warm spices. Sugar-free, deeply satisfying.</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="card reveal delay-300">
					<div class="card-top-stripe"></div>
					<div class="card-img" style="height:240px">
						<img src="https://sulacafe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Coconut-lime-cruffin.webp" alt="Lime Coconut Cruffin" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover" />
					</div>
					<div class="card-content">
						<span class="eyebrow">Tropical Tang</span>
						<h3>Lime Coconut <em>Cruffin</em></h3>
						<p>Flaky cruffin filled with tangy lime curd and sprinkled with toasted coconut.</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="card reveal delay-100" style="margin-top:24px">
					<div class="card-top-stripe"></div>
					<div class="card-img" style="height:240px">
						<img src="https://sulacafe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/tiramisu-cruffin.webp" alt="Tiramisu Cruffin" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover" />
					</div>
					<div class="card-content">
						<span class="eyebrow">Italian × Indian</span>
						<h3>Tiramisu <em>Cruffin</em></h3>
						<p>Espresso-mascarpone cream, dusted with cocoa and a hint of cardamom.</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="card reveal delay-200" style="margin-top:24px">
					<div class="card-top-stripe"></div>
					<div class="card-img" style="height:240px">
						<img src="https://sulacafe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Chocolate-croissaint-near-vancouver.webp" alt="Orange Chocolate Pain Suisse" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover" />
					</div>
					<div class="card-content">
						<span class="eyebrow">Citrus & Cocoa</span>
						<h3>Orange Chocolate <em>Pain Suisse</em></h3>
						<p>Fragrant orange zest meets silky dark chocolate. A vibrant, citrus-kissed take on a French classic.</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="card reveal delay-300" style="margin-top:24px">
					<div class="card-top-stripe"></div>
					<div class="card-img" style="height:240px">
						<img src="https://sulacafe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/pistachio-loaf.webp" alt="Pistachio Loaf" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover" />
					</div>
					<div class="card-content">
						<span class="eyebrow">Sweet & Nutty</span>
						<h3>Pistachio <em>Loaf</em></h3>
						<p>Sweet pistachio loaf finished with pistachio crumb icing. Nutty, soft, generous.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section section-cream-deep reveal" id="cookies">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="intro-block">
				<span class="eyebrow-italic">Cookies & Macaroons</span>
				<h2>Small bites, <em>big personality.</em></h2>
				<div class="premium-divider">
					<div class="pd-thin"></div>
					<div class="pd-thick"></div>
					<div class="pd-diamond"></div>
					<div class="pd-thick"></div>
					<div class="pd-thin-r"></div>
				</div>
				<p>Perfect alongside chai or coffee. Spiced, malai-soaked, espresso-deep, or simply chocolate chip.</p>
			</div>

			<div class="card-grid-3" style="margin-top:60px">
				<div class="card reveal delay-100">
					<div class="card-top-stripe"></div>
					<div class="card-img" style="height:240px">
						<img src="https://sulacafe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/chocolate-chip-cookie.webp" alt="Chocolate Chip Cookies" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover" />
					</div>
					<div class="card-content">
						<span class="eyebrow">Always Fresh</span>
						<h3>Chocolate Chip <em>Cookies</em></h3>
						<p>The classic. Soft, chewy, generous chocolate chunks.</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="card reveal delay-200">
					<div class="card-top-stripe"></div>
					<div class="card-img" style="height:240px">
						<img src="https://sulacafe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/cafe-near-me-vancouver.webp" alt="Brown Butter Espresso Cookies" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover" />
					</div>
					<div class="card-content">
						<span class="eyebrow">Buckwheat Flour</span>
						<h3>Brown Butter <em>Espresso Cookies</em></h3>
						<p>Brown butter and espresso baked into nutty buckwheat flour. Deep, rich, sophisticated.</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="card reveal delay-300">
					<div class="card-top-stripe"></div>
					<div class="card-img" style="height:240px">
						<img src="https://sulacafe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/paan-macaroons.webp" alt="Pistachio Malai Macaroons" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover" />
					</div>
					<div class="card-content">
						<span class="eyebrow">Indian Classic</span>
						<h3>Pistachio Malai <em>Macaroons</em></h3>
						<p>Soft macaroons soaked in pistachio malai cream. Indian dessert reimagined as French confection.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section section-espresso reveal">
		<div class="container text-center">
			<span class="eyebrow-italic">Order Online</span>
			<h2>Available on <em>UberEats.</em></h2>
			<div class="premium-divider premium-divider-dark">
				<div class="pd-thin"></div>
				<div class="pd-thick"></div>
				<div class="pd-diamond"></div>
				<div class="pd-thick"></div>
				<div class="pd-thin-r"></div>
			</div>
			<p style="max-width:560px;margin:24px auto 36px">Browse the full menu, customize your order, and get it delivered straight to your door.</p>
			<a href="https://www.order.store/store/sula-cafe/0egsttFCUIahN8Ja4Uqhtw" class="cta" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
				<span class="cta-badge">
					<img src="https://sulacafe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/sula-cafe-logo-2026.webp" alt="" />
				</span>
				Order on UberEats
			</a>
		</div>
	</section>

</Layout>
